          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Expand: $AA + A\\overline{B} + AB + B\\overline{B} = A + A(\\overline{B} + B) + 0 = A + A = A$. (Or use the dual of $AB + A\\overline{B} = A$.)"
        },
