          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Factor $X$: $X(Y + \\overline{Y}Z)$. By $Y + \\overline{Y}Z = Y + Z$ this becomes $X(Y + Z) = XY + XZ$."
        },
        {
          "id": "q6",
          "type": "multipleChoice",
          "prompt": "Simplify $AB + \\overline{A}C + BC$.",
